AuthorityPolicyResponse.description:
Latest authority-matrix snapshot for a customer or a live interaction.

Floor, Handoff and Customer 360 all read this shape. ``status`` is the chip;
``approvedAmount`` is the only rupee figure anyone may speak.

RoutingOrGroupRequest.description:
An OR-group of conditions inside the rule's AND-list (Habibi ``ConditionNode``).

``or`` is a keyword, so the field is ``or_`` with the wire name as its alias;
the router dumps by alias so the evaluator sees ``{"or": [...]}``.
